  "description": "After a tragic accident resulting in her death, Ms. Yeo is transported to the Cleaf Empire... for the second time! With her new identity as Yureia Cratia, she sets out to reclaim the guild she had built from the bottom up and uncover who was behind her previous murder. However, while hiding her true identity and searching for answers, she only comes up with more questions. Will she be able to find her killer before they discover that she has returned, or is she doomed to face death once again?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
